Main changes from Velo, made by Federico Morello (2026):
- IMAP IDLE push for every account, with Gmail used through XOAUTH2 as a
  new-mail signal; fix for XOAUTH2 handshakes that hung on the greeting
- Gmail sync limited to message headers, with bodies loaded on demand
- Unified inbox, search and composer across accounts
- Support for Italian certified mail (PEC): envelopes, receipts and
  delivery status
- Italian user interface, flat themes, undo and text size shortcuts
- Auto-update and release builds pointed at this fork

The original Velo README is kept in docs/README-velo.md.
